WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.538
Start with an empty flow.

00:00:01.538 --> 00:00:03.770
Drag Network Pull Stream onto the canvas.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.289
Add Person Presence Detection.

00:00:05.289 --> 00:00:08.070
Drag from the upstream node’s right port to the downstream node’s left port. Release to connect.
